# 16. What Baseline #001 Tells Us

The experiment establishes the first reference measurements for Redis on `cluster-master`.

Observed:

```text
SET ≈ 13.2K operations/sec
GET ≈ 13.0K operations/sec
```

Median latency:

```text
SET ≈ 3.70 ms
GET ≈ 3.64 ms
```

These measurements are **baseline observations**, not a claim about the maximum performance of Redis or the hardware.

The benchmark was performed under one workload configuration, and additional variables have not yet been explored.

