Operating system
Kernel
Hardware
Benchmark methodology
Dataset/workload
Request count
```

For example, during the concurrency experiment:

```text
Hardware       SAME
Redis version  SAME
Payload        SAME
Keyspace       SAME
Persistence    SAME
Replication    SAME

Clients:
1 → 10 → 50 → 100 → 250 → 500
```

This allows us to attribute observed changes primarily to client concurrency.

