# 23. Phase 1 Conclusion

Baseline #001 establishes the initial single-node Redis performance reference on the `cluster-master` machine.

### Reference result

```text
Redis 8.0.5
AMD A9-9425
2 CPU cores
6.16 GiB RAM
0 replicas
AOF disabled

SET → 13,224.02 req/s
       p50 = 3.703 ms

GET → 13,022.53 req/s
       p50 = 3.639 ms
```

This baseline will serve as the reference point for subsequent experiments.

The next phase will investigate how Redis performance changes as **client concurrency increases**, while keeping the remaining experimental variables controlled.

